      "Epoch  5 | Train Loss: 0.2332 | Val Loss: 0.6717 \n",
      "Epoch  6 | Train Loss: 0.2074 | Val Loss: 0.7480 \n",
      "Epoch  7 | Train Loss: 0.1944 | Val Loss: 0.9254 \n",
